 "notes": {
  "4183:1147": "the two young men are grandma's grandchildren; 'child' as someone's offspring is arguable",
  "4183:5494": "bare 'pop': a man pops out of the gift box, and balloons are shown",
  "613:1588": "a fighter shadowboxing in a gym; his muscles are likely on show",
  "613:1554": "the ring canvas he bounces on can be read as a mat",
  "613:5229": "after shadowboxing he leans on the ropes and is splashed with water, implying he is worn out",
  "283:5793": "the colourful patterned cloth is beautifully patterned; evaluative word describes the scene",
  "283:370": "the cloth she admires could be called elegant; evaluative, arguable",
  "4202:1297": "the dogs' faces and eyes are visible in the shot",
  "4202:4969": "bare 'bottom': the dogs lie with their underside turned up; also body part on show",
  "5141:1233": "he holds the patient's mouth open and looks inside, which looks like a dentist; narrower kind of doctor",
  "5141:189": "he wraps a blue cuff around the upper arm, which looks like bandaging",
  "5141:1561": "bare 'medicine' also means the practice of a doctor, which is the whole scene",
  "5008:6022": "bare 'threshold' is the doorway she opens and is about to step over",
  "5008:3687": "unlocking the doors to get in is gaining admission",
  "5008:4": "she wears a lanyard round her neck, which typically carries a keycard",
  "5671:692": "he pumps his fist in the air, i.e. punches the air",
  "5671:5284": "a car waits behind them (held up); he also holds his fist up",
  "5671:2945": "riding a road bike uphill is keeping balance",
  "696:1765": "bare 'rose' is also the past of rise: the smoke rose in a column",
  "322:5103": "they despair as the wheel lands, an apparent defeat before the win; win/lose scene",
  "6911:5862": "soaked people huddling in cold evening rain; 'freezing' as very cold is arguable",
  "7082:22": "bare 'bark' evokes the dog in the foreground (though it lies calmly); vines also have bark",
  "39:1836": "an ambulance and paramedics heading to a call imply a sick person",
  "246:1753": "bare 'ride': the passenger rides in the car and praises the smooth ride/drive",
  "4074:1063": "the lagoon water may be seen as blue, though the sky is orange",
  "674:2520": "bare 'hurt': she rubs her aching head, her head hurts",
  "674:2014": "she blows her blocked nose and sighs audibly",
  "5167:3334": "the clip tours the streets of a city quarter; describes the scene as a whole",
  "5168:1637": "the tarts sit in tins on a baking tray, which many call a pan",
  "5168:1140": "the woman in apron and headscarf baking for customers is a professional cook",
  "5168:2695": "the tarts are cooked with dry heat in a wood-fired oven",
  "4214:1249": "bare 'dress' as a verb: the clip is about how to dress; outfits throughout",
  "4214:2106": "the couple wear matching outfits, arguably a uniform look"
 }
}